      "value": "The TAPPaaS console (ADR-034): the site's web UI. The service runs on the mothership (tappaas-console.service, built from tappaas-cicd/ui); this module is its published face — the route through Caddy and the Authentik gate — and, when the AI stack is installed, the assistant's LiteLLM key. It installs nothing of its own.",
